Personal Knowledge Base

Purpose

Maintain structured information about the user, people, places, objects and preferences.

Responsibilities

Store long-term facts.
Provide context to automations.
Provide context to AI.
Never execute actions.

Non-responsibilities

AI reasoning.
Automation.
Notifications.




